/5357c85b-b125-41be-9e3c-a324fced95b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=244b83a1b20f54b3be84232adab3021a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed07c802/uploads/origins/5357c85b-b125-41be-9e3c-a324fced95b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=244b83a1b20f54b3be84232adab3021a, https://si.imgix.net/ed07c802/uploads/origins/5357c85b-b125-41be-9e3c-a324fced95b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=25377067c3c3e954bda6efb17bedcbec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed07c802/uploads/origins/5357c85b-b125-41be-9e3c-a324fced95b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f016727d053745defd1c3d3f5043018a 3x"}, "body": "Hello ばんからとまと! I hope you're doing well\n\nRecently, I've started to see the appeal of ryona; I really love the way you drew Mine-chan https://x.com/up25114782/status/1974018175978086457 and Koyuki-chan https://x.com/up25114782/status/1987584811876421983\n\nApologies in advance if my request is too much; please feel free to reject if it is!\n\nI'm unsure if you do original characters with unnatural skin tones but I'd love it if you drew my character please!\nhttps://i.imgur.com/gMox6OQ.png - Mother character, though depicted as stern sometimes, she has a playful side to her\n\nPlease draw her wearing childish underwear, something to add onto the humiliation; the underwear could have a cute bear design in the front or heart patterns if possible\n\nI would love it if you drew her into one of the following poses!\n1 - I really love https://x.com/up25114782/status/2052065105270210955 and https://x.com/up25114782/status/2047260664260067339/photo/1 the way Kei-chan's and Kayako-chan's heads are buried in the ground, their skirt flipped to reveal their panties is simply amazing!\n2 - I love Mine-chan's pose as well https://x.com/up25114782/status/1974018175978086457 the way she has her legs spread showing off her stockings and panties is great!\n\nThank you so much for your consideration!\nJPN-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nこんにちは、ばんからとまとさん！お元気ですか？\n\n最近、リョナの魅力に気づき始めています。あなたが描いたミネちゃん https://x.com/up25114782/status/1974018175978086457 とコユキちゃん https://x.com/up25114782/status/1987584811876421983 の作画が本当に大好きです\n\nもしリクエストが無理なものであれば、あらかじめお詫びします。もしそうなら、遠慮なくお断りしてください！\n\n不自然な肌の色をしたオリジナルキャラを描かれるかどうかわかりませんが、もし私のキャラを描いていただけたら嬉しいです！\nhttps://i.imgur.com/gMox6OQ.png - 母親キャラで、時には厳しく描かれることもありますが、遊び心のある一面もあります\n\n屈辱感を演出するために、子供っぽい下着を着せた姿で描いていただけると嬉しいです。可能であれば、下着の前面に可愛いクマの柄やハートの模様が入っていると最高です\n\n以下のポーズのいずれかで描いていただけると最高です！\n1 - こちらが特に好きです https://x.com/up25114782/ status/2052065105270210955 と https://x.com/up25114782/status/2047260664260067339/photo/1 ケイちゃんやカヤコちゃんが顔を地面に埋めて、スカートがめくれ上がってパンティが見えている様子が最高です！\n2 - ミネちゃんのポーズも大好きです https://x.com/up25114782/status/1974018175978086457 脚を広げてストッキングとパンティを見せている様子が最高です！\n\nご検討いただき、誠にありがとうございます！", "nc": 41, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@up25114782/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3685362, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/60a84a76/uploads/origins/17ebee76-c366-4c93-9fe7-82ae20a2a09a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9d2476c0692fb60f5793f4f446f936c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/60a84a76/uploads/origins/17ebee76-c366-4c93-9fe7-82ae20a2a09a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9d2476c0692fb60f5793f4f446f936c, https://si.imgix.net/60a84a76/uploads/origins/17ebee76-c366-4c93-9fe7-82ae20a2a09a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a02cf9e41d6f31779a14aae087ee4de 2x, https://si.imgix.net/60a84a76/uploads/origins/17ebee76-c366-4c93-9fe7-82ae20a2a09a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr